1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:05,098
(Sheldon:)Now, I don't see me
as some four-star general back at HQ...

2
00:00:05,268 --> 00:00:08,358
...riding a desk and playing goIf
with the Secretary of Defense.

3
00:00:08,521 --> 00:00:12,321
(Sheldon:)But I also can't be Sergeant Cooper
because that might lead you...

4
00:00:12,484 --> 00:00:16,484
...to think of me as a regular Joe. This
might take some thought. As you were.

5
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,990
- What the hell is wrong with you?
- How could you do that?

6
00:00:21,993 --> 00:00:23,783
(Raj:)Yeah, right.
You're jealous because...

7
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:27,285
...I'm Penny's number-two choice
after Leonard.

8
00:00:27,624 --> 00:00:31,164
(Howard:)Hey, if I wasn't engaged to Bernadette,
that totally could have been me.

9
00:00:32,504 --> 00:00:34,504
Please. Sheldon would've
been before you...

10
00:00:34,673 --> 00:00:37,383
(Leonard:)...and he might not even
have genitals.

11
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:40,050
(Raj:)Why do you care so much?
You're dating my sister...

12
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,890
(Raj:)...and Penny and I are in love.

13
00:00:42,055 --> 00:00:43,225
- What, heh?
- What?

14
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:46,430
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, if I may interject.

15
00:00:46,601 --> 00:00:48,981
(Sheldon:)I've decided my rank will be captain.

16
00:00:49,145 --> 00:00:51,645
(Sheldon:)If it's good enough for Kirk,
Crunch and Kangaroo...

17
00:00:51,815 --> 00:00:53,695
(Sheldon:)...it's good enough for me.

18
00:00:54,234 --> 00:00:56,944
- You're not in Iove with Penny.
- Yes, I am.

19
00:00:57,112 --> 00:01:01,282
(Raj:)The god Kamadeva has shot us
with his flowery arrows of love.

